[{:db/id "q-74407/selection/aa75c9325a2057ac1290f6e8494d30019f9fd7bad7ad3788a9b7cf9d12004416" :answer/id #uuid "ffbdfe91-1ce2-5b96-b7da-e9d6c5723d15" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}+2\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407/selection/e59e50756baad4d09a987fbeafb2fd447935bb6213194c58a5215de790fc22b8" :answer/id #uuid "c31474a9-e897-5e21-9dca-6d82f023f9ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407/selection/faaa22338e032bd9aaf15f9a9456a94a936660adb166cf15711e305992b34724" :answer/id #uuid "bfcf3d1a-f70c-51a3-aea0-17346305b26d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407/selection/bcde0201359d6a44f89bca3ec13e7e7e67592764072fa9e4766e0e415effe309" :answer/id #uuid "a34aa9e5-3650-562d-949b-cdba07b21c45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-2\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407/selection/812043b85a6ae6f9f8aeec5f70d92aeaaca8becbafae5d4e6a29b36cd2b66b58" :answer/id #uuid "842d857b-31f1-5712-a3a3-66b676c8fedd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3-\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7131b056-aaab-50e9-9652-3361506fe444" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74407/selection/faaa22338e032bd9aaf15f9a9456a94a936660adb166cf15711e305992b34724" :answer-field/choices ["q-74407/selection/aa75c9325a2057ac1290f6e8494d30019f9fd7bad7ad3788a9b7cf9d12004416" "q-74407/selection/e59e50756baad4d09a987fbeafb2fd447935bb6213194c58a5215de790fc22b8" "q-74407/selection/faaa22338e032bd9aaf15f9a9456a94a936660adb166cf15711e305992b34724" "q-74407/selection/bcde0201359d6a44f89bca3ec13e7e7e67592764072fa9e4766e0e415effe309" "q-74407/selection/812043b85a6ae6f9f8aeec5f70d92aeaaca8becbafae5d4e6a29b36cd2b66b58"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74407" :question/id #uuid "2d2caaa3-5720-58a5-a204-32175641ff19" :question/math-academy-id "q-74407" :question/problem "$\\int (3{x}^{2}+10{sin}^{2}⁡5x-10{cos}^{2}⁡5x)\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta ={cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =5x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x={cos}^{2}⁡5x-{sin}^{2}⁡5x.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3{x}^{2}+10{sin}^{2}⁡5x-10{cos}^{2}⁡5x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (3{x}^{2}-10({cos}^{2}⁡5x-{sin}^{2}⁡5x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (3{x}^{2}-10\\operatorname{cos}⁡10x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={x}^{3}-10(\\frac{1}{10}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x)+C \\\\  & ={x}^{3}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡10x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74407/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "064d3c62-5cfc-502b-aba4-48e40042593f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74407"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection/1020c76c4ff97f37043d5c7b037a269a9717b2622f250ab15b91bb15afd909e4" :answer/id #uuid "88eef018-64bb-5b92-9c2f-1ec72b23190b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-4\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection/97ae463fee934ad0d8eaa7cc97492abd67862a4fd6ee0feb82690c0a21c5607f" :answer/id #uuid "b5e0e150-4f95-50ed-81b8-24f3f0d94910" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection/de598c9b75600d63f834a864c77c503a3628f917b417d11ce7e929373b582de2" :answer/id #uuid "46b5ef69-26de-5cc2-a63e-ea09ebba0936" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection/3c50b74bbb28a7e6e538f5317703c52eb6da71291a4d9f3677a1504359b3d96d" :answer/id #uuid "0c9fa166-eeae-5071-b0a1-4bd3d34b9996" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection/a67109f2432e1dab3c0ee955f9d3dacc7dbf4444e16bce3f4e430104d9339673" :answer/id #uuid "3c91618c-4258-5a14-8cd8-01e1586709c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "16d79c9f-2069-5cd9-b62f-5a63f18b029f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74408/selection/97ae463fee934ad0d8eaa7cc97492abd67862a4fd6ee0feb82690c0a21c5607f" :answer-field/choices ["q-74408/selection/1020c76c4ff97f37043d5c7b037a269a9717b2622f250ab15b91bb15afd909e4" "q-74408/selection/97ae463fee934ad0d8eaa7cc97492abd67862a4fd6ee0feb82690c0a21c5607f" "q-74408/selection/de598c9b75600d63f834a864c77c503a3628f917b417d11ce7e929373b582de2" "q-74408/selection/3c50b74bbb28a7e6e538f5317703c52eb6da71291a4d9f3677a1504359b3d96d" "q-74408/selection/a67109f2432e1dab3c0ee955f9d3dacc7dbf4444e16bce3f4e430104d9339673"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74408" :question/id #uuid "ff8c9059-4ccd-5c34-b361-0250f8da7c82" :question/math-academy-id "q-74408" :question/problem "Calculate \n$\\int (5-8{cos}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡\\theta $ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta =2{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta -1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta +1).\n$$\n\nLetting $\\theta =2x$, we have\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡2x=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into our integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5-8{cos}^{2}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & =\\int [5-8\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int [5-4(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)]\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (1-4\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x-4(\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x)+C \\\\  & =x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74408/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b466bd78-724b-51b2-8fee-7991bf7b60d2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74408"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection/45f727b1126a8b596bd321957a3b2790a6bf2e01d28e9294eaf14b95952a0441" :answer/id #uuid "c2b31554-f53c-5090-becd-84389075d104" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x-\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection/553fb33fcde8c7fa97ecc017fd98d486a5aa03baa7cebb5e874451f236b97abf" :answer/id #uuid "832ecd68-e9de-52d4-9dfa-2eb63d77df59" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection/8798e085d9455e81d9015084235aace2b801da1d64728f29ece3debeb194c242" :answer/id #uuid "f3d2adff-a695-526c-a7a8-eaa4be5da50e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection/0a5dac34e1924cc11131a63d7de27484b43e7b085d56f2b89ef8aa480eece498" :answer/id #uuid "5c779221-1a96-5a0a-95ee-7ffce3e0d80e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x+4\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection/9fe70bda27cd3c97413e9766f87cfa6208beb26a3c3fed30edcb514d36bc2cca" :answer/id #uuid "b316147c-c6ef-56b7-b960-a1ebd09d2874" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "95f1b6f1-7c30-5049-8e29-bdaab28db919" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114703/selection/9fe70bda27cd3c97413e9766f87cfa6208beb26a3c3fed30edcb514d36bc2cca" :answer-field/choices ["q-114703/selection/45f727b1126a8b596bd321957a3b2790a6bf2e01d28e9294eaf14b95952a0441" "q-114703/selection/553fb33fcde8c7fa97ecc017fd98d486a5aa03baa7cebb5e874451f236b97abf" "q-114703/selection/8798e085d9455e81d9015084235aace2b801da1d64728f29ece3debeb194c242" "q-114703/selection/0a5dac34e1924cc11131a63d7de27484b43e7b085d56f2b89ef8aa480eece498" "q-114703/selection/9fe70bda27cd3c97413e9766f87cfa6208beb26a3c3fed30edcb514d36bc2cca"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114703" :question/id #uuid "39c87398-5175-5dc1-8cc4-8632b2bd67dc" :question/math-academy-id "q-114703" :question/problem "$\\int ({sin}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${sin}^{2}$ term: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nWe can rearrange the above formula as\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)={sin}^{2}⁡x.\n$$\n\nWe can now integrate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ({sin}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\text{d}x & =\\int (\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int (\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{1}{2}(\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x)+C \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114703/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "31f3ead1-2549-5b61-baf9-0437ba28f09d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114703"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-347169/field-1/f37b140e44c3c1469a0b674232c5aaeb4f71e6e7b8d79e0c213b062c66caacc7" :answer/id #uuid "f567a014-d677-5c69-85cf-f6da6014595b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\pi" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186288689 :answer-field/choices ["q-347169/field-1/f37b140e44c3c1469a0b674232c5aaeb4f71e6e7b8d79e0c213b062c66caacc7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348755/field-1/28f1df34d23dbda0a39aec1f79036e7c983a2f66f821a285d3bded0d11737153" :answer/id #uuid "c0781bb8-a903-5df4-b276-c5f220c5aafc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9\\pi}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-348755/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "f31cfdac-75c6-5bf0-a419-b8f355559f35" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-348755/field-1/28f1df34d23dbda0a39aec1f79036e7c983a2f66f821a285d3bded0d11737153" :answer-field/choices ["q-348755/field-1/28f1df34d23dbda0a39aec1f79036e7c983a2f66f821a285d3bded0d11737153"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-348755" :question/id #uuid "d5e356de-7912-5bf7-8fed-9681512abebd" :question/math-academy-id "q-348755" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069587/assets/e0a3fb0f4fc900f6ef8ac041ded7553f7ac44cc09f946bc3ebfee8a3235e8e94.png)\n\nFind the area $A$ of the region in the $xy$-plane that is bounded by the curve $y=5{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+2{sin}^{2}⁡(2x)+1,$ the $x$-axis and the lines $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ and $x=0,$ as shown above. Do not round the answer\n\n$A=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The area of the region is given by\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(5{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+2{sin}^{2}⁡(2x)+1)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nRecall  ${cos}^{2}⁡x+{sin}^{2}⁡x=1,$ so we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+2{sin}^{2}⁡(2x)+1 & =3{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+2({sin}^{2}⁡(2x)+{cos}^{2}⁡(2x))+1 \\\\  & =3{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHere, we use the double-angle formula for cosine that involves the ${cos}^{2}⁡x$ term, given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x=2{cos}^{2}⁡x-1.\n$$\n\n \n\nRearranging, we have\n\n$$\n2{cos}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x+1.\n$$\n\nHence, the area of the region is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(3{cos}^{2}⁡(2x)+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(\\frac{3}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+1)+3)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi /2}^{0}(\\frac{3}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡4x+\\frac{9}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={(\\frac{3}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4x+\\frac{9}{2}x)\\,|}_{-\\pi /2}^{0} \\\\  & =(\\frac{3}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡0+\\frac{9}{2}\\cdot 0)-(\\frac{3}{8}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-2\\pi )+\\frac{9}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{\\pi }{2})) \\\\  & =(0+0)-(0-\\frac{9\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-348755/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b466bd78-724b-51b2-8fee-7991bf7b60d2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-348755"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
